{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43282","headline":"洛出书 · 张钦敬","name":"洛出书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮空九洛水，瑞圣千年质。\n奇象八卦分，图书九畴出。\n含微卜筮远，抱数阴阳密。\n中得天地心，傍探鬼神吉。\n昔闻夏禹代，今献唐尧日。\n谬此叙彝伦，寰宇贺清谧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张钦敬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}